
       Multitop (Version 1.1) Coded in 1993/94 by Bobo (Mystic/X-Design)
       =================================================================
           { + }-New feature(s)         { - }-Removed feature
           { * }-changed feature        { ! }-fixed feature (Bug)
           { # }-Information            { ? }-let me know if this work

Multitop v1.0 (12-22-93 > 01-15-94) - [Private version for my board]
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
               First version, Private for my own board!

12-22-93 { + } I started coding this door.
12-23-93 { + } Coded the routine for reading all accounts in the user.data
               into memory.
12-24-93 { + } Inserted a sort routine (Coded by Looby!)
 - ^^ -  { + } Top Uploaders (Bytes) and Top Downloaders (Bytes) coded.
12-25-93 { + } Fixed the design.

Multitop v1.1 (01-15-94 > 02-25-94) - [First public release version]
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
01-15-94 { + } Recoded Multitop, now much more faster.
01-16-94 { + } Added Top Uploaders (Files), Top Downloaders (Files), 
               Top Calls, Top Msg, Top Upload CPS, Top Download CPS.
01-17-94 { * } Now geting the right username when using Top UL CPS, Top DL CPS
01-18-94 { ! } Multitop would bug if there wasn't enough users in userdata.
               Multitop will now display empty places.
02-10-94 { * } Now Multitop is skipping the first user in userdata/userkeys.
               This maybe will be an option in the future, tell me if you need it!
02-12-94 { + } Optimized the source. Before: 14309 Now: 13245.
               Abit faster too, since i have removed abit unused code etc etc.
 - ^^ -  { ? } If any one have some more design ideas, tell me! I am planing on
               making so you can choose what design mode you want. Etc, you can
               choice if you want to have two colums or one colum etc.
02-21-94 { + } Now you can have a header/tailer. They should be named
               S:Multitop.Header and S:Multitop.Tailer.
02-25-94 { * } All debug and registration routines removed from code.
